===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# {{lb|en|medicine}} The science of drugs including their origin, composition, [[pharmacokinetics]], therapeutic use, and [[toxicology]].
# {{lb|en|medicine}} The properties and reactions of drugs especially with relation to their therapeutic value.

